From: Tiberiu Chibici <chibicitiberiu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 15:57:00 +0200
Subject: Build profile pkg.game-data-packager.nowrappers: the tool without the
 engine wrappers

Walnut ships game-data-packager and game-data-packager-runtime only. The quake, quake2 and
quake3 wrapper packages and their dedicated servers come from the same source; built here they
would carry our +ps3 version into Walnut's suites and sit beside our own launchers for those
engines (QuakeSpasm, Yamagi Quake II). The profile leaves them out (packages/patched/tools/
game-data-packager/package.conf NATIVE_PROFILES); without it the source builds what Debian's does.

Forwarded: not-needed

diff --git a/debian/control b/debian/control
--- a/debian/control
+++ b/debian/control
@@ -433,6 +433,7 @@ Description: Helper libraries required by legacy i386 binary-only games
 
 Package: quake
 Architecture: all
+Build-Profiles: <!pkg.game-data-packager.nowrappers>
 Pre-Depends:
  ${misc:Pre-Depends},
 Depends:
@@ -470,6 +471,7 @@ Description: classic gothic/horror-themed first person shooter
 
 Package: quake-server
 Architecture: all
+Build-Profiles: <!pkg.game-data-packager.nowrappers>
 Pre-Depends:
  ${misc:Pre-Depends},
 Depends:
@@ -491,6 +493,7 @@ Description: classic first person shooter - server and init script
 
 Package: quake2
 Architecture: all
+Build-Profiles: <!pkg.game-data-packager.nowrappers>
 Pre-Depends:
  ${misc:Pre-Depends},
 Depends:
@@ -523,6 +526,7 @@ Description: classic science-fiction-themed first person shooter
 
 Package: quake2-server
 Architecture: all
+Build-Profiles: <!pkg.game-data-packager.nowrappers>
 Pre-Depends:
  ${misc:Pre-Depends},
 Depends:
@@ -549,6 +553,7 @@ Description: dedicated server for Quake II
 
 Package: quake3
 Architecture: all
+Build-Profiles: <!pkg.game-data-packager.nowrappers>
 Pre-Depends:
  ${misc:Pre-Depends},
 Depends:
@@ -576,6 +581,7 @@ Description: Quake III Arena menu entry and launcher scripts
 
 Package: quake3-server
 Architecture: all
+Build-Profiles: <!pkg.game-data-packager.nowrappers>
 Pre-Depends:
  ${misc:Pre-Depends},
 Depends:
